doctype html
html(lang="en")
  head
    meta(charset="UTF-8")
    meta(name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0")
    title Abstract Review Invitation - SCM Conference 2026

  body(
    style="margin:0; padding:0; background-color:#FDFCFB; font-family:'Segoe UI', Arial, sans-serif;"
  )
    .wrapper(style="padding:30px 10px;")
      .container(
        style="max-width:600px; margin:auto; background:#ffffff; border-radius:20px; overflow:hidden; box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.05); border:1px solid #f1f5f9;"
      )

        //- HEADER
        include header

        .content(style="padding:40px;")
          h2(
            style=`margin:0 0 25px; color:${brandBlue}; font-size:24px;`
          )
            | Abstract Review Invitation

          p(style="margin:0 0 18px; font-size:15px; line-height:1.8;")
            | Dear #{name}

          p(style="margin:0 0 18px; font-size:15px; line-height:1.8;")
            | Greetings from the Organizing Committee of the
            strong  International Conference on Building Resilient Supply Chains 2026
            | , hosted by the Department of Business Administration, East West University, Bangladesh.

          p(style="margin:0 0 18px; font-size:15px; line-height:1.8;")
            | We are inviting you to review an abstract that was submitted to the conference, considering your expertise in the relevant subject area.

          p(style="margin:0 0 18px; font-size:15px; line-height:1.8;")
            | The conference follows a rigorous double-blind peer review process to ensure a high standard of academic evaluation. We request that you assess the assigned abstract in accordance with the conference guidelines and provide your review within the stipulated timeframe.

          table(
            width="100%"
            border="0"
            cellspacing="0"
            cellpadding="0"
            style=`margin:30px 0; background:#f8fafc; border-left:4px solid ${brandGold}; border-radius:8px;`
          )
            tr
              td(style="padding:22px 24px;")
                p(style="margin:0; font-size:14px;")
                  strong Review Deadline:
                  |  #{reviewDeadline}

          p(style="margin:0 0 18px; font-size:15px; line-height:1.8;")
            | Please evaluate the submission based on its originality, appropriateness of the methodology applied, significance of the study, and overall contribution to the field of supply chain management.

          p(style="color:#475569; font-size:15px; line-height:1.8; margin-top:30px;")
            | Please confirm whether you are willing to review this abstract by selecting one of the options below:

          //- ACTION BUTTONS
          .actions(style="text-align:center; margin:30px 0;")
            a(
              href=agree_link
              style="display:inline-block; margin:5px; padding:12px 22px; background:#16a34a; color:#ffffff; text-decoration:none; border-radius:10px; font-size:12px; font-weight:900; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:1px;"
            )
              | Accept Review

            a(
              href=disagree_link
              style="display:inline-block; margin:5px; padding:12px 22px; background:#dc2626; color:#ffffff; text-decoration:none; border-radius:10px; font-size:12px; font-weight:900; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:1px;"
            )
              | Decline

          //- FALLBACK LINKS
          p(style="color:#64748b; font-size:12px; margin-top:20px;")
            | If the buttons do not work, use the links below:

          p(style="font-size:12px; word-break:break-all;")
            strong Accept:
            |  #{agree_link}

          p(style="font-size:12px; word-break:break-all;")
            strong Decline:
            |  #{disagree_link}

          //- EXPIRY NOTICE
          .notice(
            style="margin-top:25px; padding:15px; background:#fff7ed; border:1px solid #fed7aa; border-radius:10px;"
          )
            p(
              style="margin:0; font-size:12px; color:#c2410c; font-weight:600;"
            )
              | ⏳ This invitation will expire soon. Please respond promptly.

          p(style="margin:0 0 18px; font-size:15px; line-height:1.8;")
            | We appreciate your time and contribution in maintaining the quality and integrity of this international conference.

          p(style="margin:0 0 18px; font-size:15px; line-height:1.8;")
            | Should you have any questions or require further assistance, please contact us at

            a(
              href="mailto:helpdesk-scm@ewubd.edu"
              style=`color:${brandBlue}; text-decoration:none; font-weight:bold;`
            )
              | helpdesk-scm@ewubd.edu

          p(style="margin:30px 0 0; font-size:15px; line-height:1.8;")
            | Thank you for your continued support and collaboration.

        //- FOOTER
        include footer

